whether to filter out adult or unsafe content from results. Not supported for <code node="[object Object]"><span>fast</span></code> or <code node="[object Object]"><span>ultra-fast</span></code> search depths.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="api-section"><div class="api-section-heading flex flex-col gap-y-4 w-full"><div class="flex items-baseline border-b pb-2.5 border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-800 w-full"><h4 class="api-section-heading-title flex-1 mb-0">Response</h4><div class="flex items-center"><div class="flex items-center gap-x-3 font-mono text-xs"><div class="relative flex items-center px-2 py-0.5 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 font-medium bg-transparent dark:bg-transparent hover:text-zinc-950 dark:hover:text-white transition-all"><button type="button" tabindex="0" aria-haspopup="menu" id="base-ui-_R_rlmj4jddbsnlhjiuasnpfiutb_" class="group group overflow-hidden rounded-lg disabled:pointer-events-none [&amp;&gt;span]:line-clamp-1 flex items-center gap-1 py-0.5 group-hover:text-stone-950/70 dark:group-hover:text-white/70 font-mono text-xs text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 hover:text-gray-950 dark:hover:text-white px-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span>200</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down-icon lucide-chevron-down h-2.5 w-2.5 text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 shrink-0"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></div></button></div><div class="relative flex items-center px-2 py-0.5 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 hover:text-gray-950 dark:hover:text-white font-medium bg-transparent dark:bg-transparent"><button type="button" data-disabled="" tabindex="0" disabled="" aria-haspopup="menu" id="base-ui-_R_tlmj4jddbsnlhjiuasnpfiutb_" class="group group overflow-hidden rounded-lg disabled:pointer-events-none [&amp;&gt;span]:line-clamp-1 